      "sc:description": "BRANCHSNV reports strict clade-exclusive nucleotide markers separately from single-nucleotide substitutions reconstructed on a selected edge of a rooted phylogenetic tree, while retaining ambiguity across equally parsimonious ancestral-state reconstructions.",
